# Production pipeline: insert candidate self-audit and qualification, rewrite ordered graph.
append_once('docs/production-pipeline.en.md','## 06 · Blind Reader',
'''## 05A · Diagnostic candidate and manager qualification loop\n\nSurface realization freezes a **diagnostic candidate**, not a release-qualified candidate. Only after this fingerprint exists may post-generation regression evidence and rule material enter the critic/editor side of the graph.\n\nThe manager runs `quality.candidate_self_audit` on sentence/utterance, local-block, and scene/cluster scales. The audit is semantic and non-independent. It includes the Delete Test, micro-action function, explanation-after-evidence, semantic ownership, AI-explanation rhythm, SAFE-BUT-FLAT interfaces, and the three-layer **FUNCTION → OWNERSHIP → NATURAL REALIZATION** test. Functional prose can still fail when it is visibly over-authored, punchline-first, narrator-optimized, or implausibly polished for the current speaker and pressure. Legitimately witty/charismatic prose remains valid when it is purpose-first, character-owned, situation-appropriate and consequential.\n\nA material blocking finding routes repair to the owning mechanism. A cluster failure is not fixed by synonym replacement. Material repair creates a new candidate fingerprint and invalidates old qualification/review evidence.''')
append_once('docs/production-pipeline.zh-CN.md','## 06 · Blind Reader',
'''## 05A · Diagnostic candidate 与 manager qualification loop\n\nSurface realization 冻结的是 **diagnostic candidate**，不是已经有 release 资格的 candidate。只有 exact fingerprint 存在以后，post-generation regression evidence / rule material 才能进入 critic/editor 一侧。\n\nManager 对 sentence/utterance、local block、scene/cluster 三个尺度执行 `quality.candidate_self_audit`。它是 semantic、但 `independent=false`，至少包含 Delete Test、micro-action function、explanation-after-evidence、semantic ownership、AI-explanation rhythm、SAFE-BUT-FLAT interface，以及 **FUNCTION → OWNERSHIP → NATURAL REALIZATION** 三层测试。有叙事功能的句子仍可能因为 visibly over-authored、punchline-first、narrator-optimized，或不符合当前 speaker/压力而失败；真正 purpose-first、character-owned、情境合理且有后果的机智/魅力表达仍然合法。\n\nMaterial blocking finding 必须回 owning mechanism。Cluster failure 不能靠逐句换词解决。Material repair 产生新 candidate fingerprint，同时使旧 qualification/review evidence stale。''')
append_once('docs/production-pipeline.en.md','## 11 · Independent semantic review',
'''### Pre-independent qualification is blocking\n\nBefore any `quality.production_review` job can be constructed or dispatched, deterministic runtime requires a valid `novelforge_candidate_qualification_v1` for the exact current candidate and subject. It composes already-completed self-audit, Reader Engagement and continuity evidence; it does not make a literary judgment. `awaiting_semantic` or `repair_required`, any unresolved blocking finding, or a fingerprint mismatch hard-refuses dispatch. The qualification proof is runtime-only and is stripped before the independent reviewer sees the job.\n\nIndependent PASS cannot override a failed or stale qualification. Independent FAIL returns to the owning repair layer; the repaired artifact gets a new fingerprint, must qualify again, and normally receives a fresh independent review.''')
append_once('docs/production-pipeline.zh-CN.md','## 11 · Independent semantic review',
'''### Pre-independent qualification 是 blocking gate\n\n任何 `quality.production_review` job 在构造/dispatch 前，deterministic runtime 都必须拿到 exact current candidate + subject 的有效 `novelforge_candidate_qualification_v1`。它只组合已经完成的 self-audit、Reader Engagement、continuity evidence，不做文学判断。`awaiting_semantic`、`repair_required`、任何 unresolved blocking finding 或 fingerprint mismatch 都会 hard-refuse dispatch。Qualification proof 只属于 runtime，独立 reviewer 看到 job 前必须剥离。\n\nIndependent PASS 不能覆盖 failed/stale qualification。Independent FAIL 回 owning repair layer；修过的 artifact 获得新 fingerprint，必须重新 qualification，并通常使用 fresh independent review。''')
rep('docs/production-pipeline.en.md',
'''6. Writer Raw Draft, Surface realization, then candidate fingerprint freeze;\n7. Blind Reader;\n8. Semantic Rule Auditor when required;\n9. Editor repair specification and repair/challenger comparison when warranted;\n10. continuity/state checks;\n11. required independent semantic gate;\n12. user-visible Review Draft;\n13. explicit acceptance, followed by `SETTLE` as a separate mode/transaction.''',
'''6. Writer Raw Draft, Surface realization, then diagnostic candidate fingerprint freeze;\n7. manager/internal Candidate Self-Audit plus Project regression/ownership/natural-realization audit;\n8. Blind Reader;\n9. Semantic Rule Auditor when required;\n10. Editor repair specification and repair/challenger comparison when warranted; material repair creates a new fingerprint and repeats the bounded loop;\n11. continuity/state checks;\n12. exact pre-independent qualification receipt;\n13. required independent semantic gate;\n14. user-visible Review Draft;\n15. explicit acceptance, followed by `SETTLE` as a separate mode/transaction.''')
rep('docs/production-pipeline.zh-CN.md',
'''6. Writer Raw Draft、Surface realization，然后冻结 candidate fingerprint；\n7. Blind Reader；\n8. 必要时 Semantic Rule Auditor；\n9. Editor repair specification，以及必要的 repair/challenger comparison；\n10. continuity/state checks；\n11. required independent semantic gate；\n12. user-visible Review Draft；\n13. explicit acceptance，随后由独立 `SETTLE` mode/transaction 完成 settlement。''',
'''6. Writer Raw Draft、Surface realization，然后冻结 diagnostic candidate fingerprint；\n7. manager/internal Candidate Self-Audit + Project regression / ownership / natural-realization audit；\n8. Blind Reader；\n9. 必要时 Semantic Rule Auditor；\n10. Editor repair specification，以及必要的 repair/challenger comparison；material repair 产生新 fingerprint 并重复 bounded loop；\n11. continuity/state checks；\n12. exact pre-independent qualification receipt；\n13. required independent semantic gate；\n14. user-visible Review Draft；\n15. explicit acceptance，随后由独立 `SETTLE` mode/transaction 完成 settlement。''')
append_once('docs/production-pipeline.en.md','## Exact references',
'''## 14 · Known regression escape: the user is not the default linter\n\nUser feedback that reveals a genuinely unmodeled failure is valuable discovery. But when a mechanism is already present in Framework fundamentals, Project regression evidence, current learning evidence, or the active self-audit rubric and still reaches the user, treat that recurrence as a **manager/quality-loop escape**. `quality/regression_escape.py` records the exact candidate, known mechanism, expected catch stage, actual catch stage, and whether the user had to detect it; the runtime does not create the literary verdict.\n\nA two-round acceptance control is required: after a synthetic mechanism is established as known, a later semantically matching candidate must be blocked by manager self-audit before user-visible delivery. Repeated user-first detection of the same known AI-realization mechanism means the quality loop has not met its objective. The learned unit is the mechanism, never a literal phrase ban.''')
append_once('docs/production-pipeline.zh-CN.md','## 精确参考',
'''## 14 · Known regression escape：用户不是默认 linter\n\nUser feedback 如果揭示真正未建模的新 failure，是高价值 discovery。但一个 mechanism 已经存在于 Framework Fundamentals、Project regression evidence、current learning evidence 或 active self-audit rubric，却仍然到达用户，就应记录为 **manager / quality-loop escape**。`quality/regression_escape.py` 只记录 exact candidate、known mechanism、expected catch stage、actual catch stage，以及是否由 user 首检；runtime 不创建文学 verdict。\n\nAcceptance 必须包含两轮 synthetic control：Round 1 将 mechanism 建立为 known；Round 2 出现语义上同机制的 candidate 时，manager self-audit 必须在 user-visible delivery 前阻断。如果同一 known AI-realization failure 连续仍主要由 user 首先发现，说明 quality loop 没达到目标。Learning unit 是 mechanism，不是 literal phrase ban。''')

# Semantic worker protocol: qualification proof is execution metadata, not reviewer context.
append_once('harness/semantic_workers/SEMANTIC_WORKER_PROTOCOL.en.md','## 12 · Retry semantics',
'''### Pre-independent qualification proof\n\nA workflow may require a non-independent semantic qualification before an independent job becomes dispatchable. This proof is deterministic execution metadata: it binds the exact current candidate to completed manager-side quality evidence and can hard-block dispatch. It is **not** part of the reviewer-visible semantic question and must be stripped from the blind worker packet. Manager qualification remains `independent=false` and never satisfies the independent gate.''')
append_once('harness/semantic_workers/SEMANTIC_WORKER_PROTOCOL.zh-CN.md','## 12 · Retry semantics',
'''### Pre-independent qualification proof\n\nWorkflow 可以要求 independent job 在 dispatch 前先有一个 non-independent semantic qualification。这个 proof 属于 deterministic execution metadata：它把 exact current candidate 绑定到已经完成的 manager-side quality evidence，并可以 hard-block dispatch。它**不是** reviewer-visible semantic question 的一部分，进入 blind worker packet 前必须剥离。Manager qualification 始终 `independent=false`，永远不能满足 independent gate。''')

# Quality assurance: make the manager-side gate and escape metric visible.
append_once('docs/quality-assurance.en.md','## 11 · Semantic judgment and independent judgment are different',
'''## 10A · Qualify before independent review\n\nThe manager is expected to catch known Surface/regression/AI-realization/Reader-Grip failures before the mandatory independent reviewer. `quality.candidate_self_audit` supplies semantic diagnosis; `quality/candidate_qualification.py` only validates exact bindings and blocks dispatch until self-audit, Reader Engagement, and continuity are resolved for the same fingerprint.\n\nFunction is not enough: salient dialogue/narration is tested for **function, semantic ownership, and natural realization**. A useful line can still be visibly over-authored. This does not ban wit, metaphors, punchlines, or complete sentences; context/profile/voice decide whether the realization is owned and plausible.\n\nKnown mechanisms that reach the user are observable through `novelforge_known_regression_escape_v1`. This is QA telemetry, not a new literary classifier. New user discoveries remain legitimate; repeated user-first detection of an already-known failure is evidence that audit coverage, repair routing, context selection, or qualification failed.''')
append_once('docs/quality-assurance.zh-CN.md','## 11 · Semantic judgment 与 independent judgment 不是一回事',
'''## 10A · Independent review 前先 qualification\n\nManager 的职责是先挡住已经知道的 Surface / regression / AI-realization / Reader-Grip failure，再把 candidate 送 mandatory independent reviewer。`quality.candidate_self_audit` 提供 semantic diagnosis；`quality/candidate_qualification.py` 只验证 exact binding，并在同一 fingerprint 的 self-audit、Reader Engagement、continuity 尚未解决时阻断 dispatch。\n\n有功能还不够：salient dialogue/narration 继续检查 **function、semantic ownership、natural realization**。一句有用的话仍可能 visibly over-authored。这不禁止 wit、metaphor、punchline 或完整句；是否属于当前人物/POV/情境由 semantic judgment + profile/voice boundary 决定。\n\n已知 mechanism 如果仍到达用户，用 `novelforge_known_regression_escape_v1` 做 QA observability；它不是新的文学 classifier。新的 user discovery 仍然有价值；但同一 known failure 反复由 user 首检，说明 audit coverage、repair routing、context selection 或 qualification 发生 escape。''')

# Spec / plan / tasks addendum.
append_once('specs/014-pre-independent-candidate-qualification/spec.en.md','## Acceptance criterion',
'''## Known-regression recurrence and user role\n\nUser feedback has two distinct meanings. A genuinely new failure mechanism is **discovery** and may create a narrow learning/regression/eval candidate. A previously known mechanism that survives the active manager quality loop and is first found by the user is a **known-regression escape**. It must not be disguised as an ordinary preference adjustment.\n\n`novelforge_known_regression_escape_v1` records candidate fingerprint, mechanism identity, expected catch stage, actual detection stage, user-detected flag, known-evidence refs, and detection refs. The runtime never decides the literary mechanism itself.\n\nAcceptance includes a two-round synthetic recurrence control: Round 1 establishes a mechanism as known; Round 2 repeats the same mechanism in a new candidate. The manager self-audit must block Round 2 before user-visible delivery. If the same known AI-realization failure is still mainly user-first-detected across repeated rounds, this feature is not done. Mechanism-level semantic applicability remains context-sensitive; literal phrases are never globally banned.''')
append_once('specs/014-pre-independent-candidate-qualification/spec.zh-CN.md','## Acceptance criterion',
'''## Known-regression recurrence 与 user role\n\nUser feedback 有两种不同意义。Framework 尚未稳定建模的新 failure mechanism 属于 **discovery**，可以生成最窄 learning/regression/eval candidate；已经 known 的 mechanism 在 active manager quality loop 后仍逃到用户，并由 user 首先发现，则属于 **known-regression escape**，不能包装成普通 preference adjustment。\n\n`novelforge_known_regression_escape_v1` 记录 candidate fingerprint、mechanism identity、expected catch stage、actual detection stage、user-detected flag、known-evidence refs、detection refs；runtime 不自己判断文学 mechanism。\n\nAcceptance 包含两轮 synthetic recurrence control：Round 1 建立 known mechanism；Round 2 在新 candidate 中重复同机制，manager self-audit 必须在 user-visible delivery 前阻断。若同一种 known AI-realization failure 多轮仍主要由 user 首检，本 feature 不算完成。Applicability 仍是 context-sensitive semantic judgment；literal phrase 永远不是全局禁令。''')
append_once('specs/014-pre-independent-candidate-qualification/plan.en.md','## Phase 7 · Verification',
'''## Addendum · User is not the regression detector\n\nVerification includes `known_regression_escape` observability and a two-round end-to-end synthetic recurrence control. New user discovery is not a failure; repeated user-first detection of a previously-known mechanism is a quality-loop escape and fails acceptance until the owning audit/repair/qualification mechanism is corrected.''')
append_once('specs/014-pre-independent-candidate-qualification/plan.zh-CN.md','## Phase 7 · Verification',
'''## Addendum · User 不是 regression detector\n\nVerification 增加 `known_regression_escape` observability 与两轮 end-to-end synthetic recurrence control。User 发现真正 new mechanism 不算失败；但 previously-known mechanism 仍反复由 user 首检，就是 quality-loop escape，必须修 owning audit / repair / qualification mechanism 后才能通过 acceptance。''')
append_once('specs/014-pre-independent-candidate-qualification/tasks.en.md','- [ ] T17 Open draft PR; do not merge or repin the consumer Project.',
'''- [ ] T16A Verify `known_regression_escape` distinguishes new discovery from known recurrence.\n- [ ] T16B Pass the two-round known-regression recurrence test before user-visible delivery.\n- [ ] T16C Verify legitimate witty/charismatic negative controls remain allowed.''')
append_once('specs/014-pre-independent-candidate-qualification/tasks.zh-CN.md','- [ ] T17 Open draft PR; do not merge or repin consumer Project。',
'''- [ ] T16A 验证 `known_regression_escape` 能区分 new discovery 与 known recurrence。\n- [ ] T16B 通过两轮 known-regression recurrence pre-user blocking test。\n- [ ] T16C 验证 legitimate witty / charismatic negative control 不被误杀。''')

